{"4131830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Parabless", "steam_appid": 4131830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131830/extras/63f81ecc936086f95db9fffdcb465cc3.avif?t=1782324698\" width=1080 height=128 /></span><strong>Play modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131830/extras/7142ae0b3050ac57cc6f6552aa0afd8e.avif?t=1782324698\" width=160 height=228 /></span>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131830/extras/82878b920adf817dc226baa1b49d1622.avif?t=1782324698\" width=160 height=228 /></span>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131830/extras/2a86202f3c2b66ea4923096787725087.avif?t=1782324698\" width=160 height=228 /></span>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131830/extras/72d9c856ed6e838cb6f1eb1b4ba4353d.avif?t=1782324698\" width=160 height=228 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Adventure</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through story levels and unlock rewards!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Singleplayer</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against computer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Multiplayer</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual and ranked mode.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Colosseum</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle online for increasing rewards with deck drafting. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Seven Classes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131830/extras/d4a82c980b04ff728d3feebb3e149781.avif?t=1782324698\" width=330 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Saint - </strong>Blessed by God, you are called to heal and build what is left to ruin and destruction. Your hands rebuild what sin and strife have undone.<strong> </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131830/extras/122adf7205769c47ba8a049885ea5785.avif?t=1782324698\" width=330 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shepherd -</strong> Animals of the earth are you friends. You protect them and they provide for you. The more the merrier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131830/extras/7ccc32eca13b31253813624ef14da593.avif?t=1782324698\" width=330 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gardener -</strong> A child of nature, your power flows from natural growth. Your options branch and spread, like the plants that thrive under your care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131830/extras/bd2bb458206ef175868097c1edb913f7.avif?t=1782324698\" width=330 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>King - </strong>Crowned by divine right, your word is command and your will is law. Under your rule, men and nations prosper with a blessing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131830/extras/440f2c543a092b27291deff591d1422e.avif?t=1782324698\" width=330 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>System - </strong>A disembodied spirit in a man-made vessel, your unholy passion is to enslave and destroy mankind. Tech is your realm, and all machines march for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131830/extras/bf57986855e4732b7a7fccce1ac47847.avif?t=1782324698\" width=330 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sinner - </strong>A criminal, thief, and robber, your life is defined by murder, plot, and betrayal. Gold is your god, and betrayal your prayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131830/extras/c906fc418dee55247b8256d434543366.avif?t=1782324698\" width=330 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Occultist -</strong> The enemy of all good, you pay a terrible price to gain temporary power, your power is vast, your torment certain.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131830/extras/63f81ecc936086f95db9fffdcb465cc3.avif?t=1782324698\" width=1080 height=128 /></span><strong>Play modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131830/extras/7142ae0b3050ac57cc6f6552aa0afd8e.avif?t=1782324698\" width=160 height=228 /></span>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131830/extras/82878b920a